    "course_pol": "認真參與、學習態度與出席被視為重要的評分參考依據。\n詳細的課堂規則將於第一週進行說明，若有後續加選者請於加選時跟授課教師確認。",
    "course_pol_en": "Serious participation, attitude towards learning and attendance are considered important criteria for grading.\nDetailed classroom rules will be explained in the first week. If you want to add an option later, please confirm with the instructor when you add an option.\n認真參與、學習態度與出席被視為重要的評分參考依據。\n詳細的課堂規則將於第一週進行說明，若有後續加選者請於加選時跟授課教師確認。",
    "course_rem": "認真參與、學習態度與出席被視為重要的評分參考依據。\n詳細的課堂規則將於第一週進行說明，若有後續加選者請於加選時跟授課教師確認。",
    "course_rem_en": "Serious participation, attitude towards learning and attendance are considered important criteria for grading.\nDetailed classroom rules will be explained in the first week. If you want to add an option later, please confirm with the instructor when you add an option.\n認真參與、學習態度與出席被視為重要的評分參考依據。\n詳細的課堂規則將於第一週進行說明，若有後續加選者請於加選時跟授課教師確認。",
    "ais_meno": "<div>課程活動內容將根據導師與學校安排來進行，為保障師生於教師中的安全，學生須注意自身的言語與行動之表現，若有超出學校校規所規範之行為可能受到相對的處分。&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>The content of course activities will be carried out according to the arrangements of the instructor and the school. In order to ensure the safety of teachers and students, students must pay attention to their own words and actions. If there are behaviors that exceed the regulations of the school, they may be punished accordingly.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
